{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter the arena as a deadly <i>spinner</i> in <i><strong>Spinner</strong></i><strong>: Rogueblade</strong>, a fast-paced 3D\u00a0<strong>roguelike</strong>. <strong>Customize</strong> your <i>spinner</i>\u2019s parts and abilities, blaze through <strong>dynamic, realistic arenas</strong>, and shatter your enemies in a shower of <strong>sparks</strong> and<strong> </strong>steel.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif4.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is unique, every battle more intense than the last. Upgrade your <i>spinner</i> with powerful temporary abilities and permanent unlocks. Survive the chaos, master the spin, and climb through the ranks of ever-evolving destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pure action, endless upgrades! Every battle pushes your limits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1. Hardcore Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif7.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience intense clashes with realistic physics and visual effects. Knock back your enemies, wear them down through friction, and break spinners into pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2. Deep Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own spinner by customizing its body, blades, and tip. Create a unique battle top tailored to your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3. Realistic Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter brutal roguelike arenas with high-quality graphics, immersive effects, and responsive sound design that bring every battle to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4. Interactive Maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight in dynamic environments where snow melts, grass tears, soil crumbles, sand scatters, and glass shatters \u2014 all in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>5. Special Powers &amp; Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif8.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spinners can unleash elemental abilities such as fire, sparks, or ice \u2014 and feature distinct traits like speed, strength, or durability depending on their structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6. Unique Spirits &amp; Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has a unique fighting style and spirit-based abilities. Unleash your own spinner's power to unlock powerful ultimates and dominate the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739530?t=1749396289","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/67208c3d9b6492dee8a55d9d68c27ce2dcf1e051/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749396289","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st