h as fire, sparks, or ice \u2014 and feature distinct traits like speed, strength, or durability depending on their structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6. Unique Spirits &amp; Bosses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/extras/gif5.gif?t=1749396289\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each boss has a unique fighting style and spirit-based abilities. Unleash your own spinner's power to unlock powerful ultimates and dominate the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Ancient Tech"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739530/b5758303dc25fd4e84153245fa49edfa45654152/header.jpg?t=1749396289","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 520 / NVIDIA GeForce GT 710 / AMD Radeon Vega 3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145413,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145413/movie480.mp4?t=1749395453","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145413/movie_max.mp4?t=1749395453"},"name":"Combat Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257145413/a2232ee02d7652c3be08c81eb4bf404c19862d81/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749395453","webm":{"480